                        "review": "Two years ago there was a low depressive period of my life where playing Hades II was the only habit and source of stability I could afford. It cradled me, gave enough comfort so I rested and recharged. \n\n500 hours in I'm still in love, devoted, surprised with the game\nI love art direction\nI love all the little environment details\nI love writing \nI love voice acting\nI love how combat flows\n\n10/10, my perfect comfort game\nthank you 💙",
